<mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="2" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;whiteSpace=wrap;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;LaminarFlow-Backend/internal/frontend/frontend.go&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" x="850" y="980" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="3" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;: http.Handler&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;satisfied implicitly — ServeHTTP on *handler is the whole interface. Not linked: stdlib&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="40" width="700" x="850" y="1010" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="4" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Andale Mono&quot;&gt;type … struct&lt;/font&gt; — unexported (~); the concrete http.Handler behind &lt;a href=&quot;#func#New&quot;&gt;frontend.New&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;serves the built React bundle same-origin with the API — one process, one port (Architecture §2)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="40" width="700" x="850" y="1050" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="5" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;type &lt;b&gt;handler&lt;/b&gt; struct&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="30" width="700" x="850" y="1090" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="6" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font&gt;(&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;~ fsys: fs.FS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font&gt;)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;from the factory &lt;a href=&quot;#func#New&quot;&gt;New&lt;/a&gt;(fsys fs.FS) http.Handler — the bundle this handler serves&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="700" x="850" y="1120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Attributes&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;~ files: fs.FS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;the only field: the embedded dist/ subtree, or os.DirFS(FRONTEND_DIR) — &lt;a href=&quot;#func#frontendFS&quot;&gt;frontendFS&lt;/a&gt; picks&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;set once by New and never written again, so one handler is safe across concurrent requests&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="80" width="700" x="850" y="1200" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontFamily=Andale Mono;fontSize=14;resizeHeight=1;autosize=0;fixedWidth=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Methods&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;+ &lt;a href=&quot;#func#handler.ServeHTTP&quot;&gt;ServeHTTP&lt;/a&gt;(w: http.ResponseWriter, r: *http.Request)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;~ &lt;a href=&quot;#func#handler.serveFile&quot;&gt;serveFile&lt;/a&gt;(w, r, name: string, hashed: bool): bool&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;both take the pointer receiver h *handler; serveFile&#39;s w and r are the same pair&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;serveFile reports true when it wrote a response, false when name is not in the bundle&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="100" width="700" x="850" y="1280" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
